## AuxiNux Virtua application repository — persists on the INSTALLED system so the
## Virtua panel (auxinux-virtua) and the updater (virtuaos-cli) can be upgraded
## with `virtuaos update` / `apt`. Same host and signing key as the kernel suite,
## different Suite (`virtua` vs `kernel`). The keyring is the one provisioned at
## build time by build.sh from dep.auxinux.ca/VIRTUA/virtua-archive-keyring.asc —
## a single key file signs both suites, so we reference it here too (rather than
## inlining the key) to keep one source of truth.
Types: deb
URIs: https://dep.auxinux.ca/VIRTUA
Suites: virtua
Components: main
Architectures: amd64
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/virtua-archive-keyring.asc
